 - a fixed-step game runs at double speed (or slow motion at 30) after `DM_FPS_TARGET` is set, in `Documents/env.txt` or the launcher, on a build its profile's frame step stubs and limiter rows do not know. → [A present cap applies only with a frame step or an engine limit the host writes](../reference/frame-rate.md#a-present-cap-applies-only-with-a-frame-step-or-an-engine-limit-the-host-writes)
